    "Itemized Passive Description": "*Basic effect(s)*\n- Can perform Reversible Exchange with Jeice\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Receives an additional Ki +2 per AGL Ki Sphere obtained\n- High chance of evading enemy's attack\n*When there are 3 Extreme Class allies attacking in the same turn*\n- ATK & DEF 20%{passiveImg:up_g} per Ki Sphere obtained\n*For every Ki Sphere obtained*\n- ATK & DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*For every AGL Ki Sphere obtained*\n- Chance of evading enemy's attack & damage reduction rate 10%{passiveImg:up_g}\n(up to 30%)\n- DEF 30%{passiveImg:up_g} when receiving an attack\n*4 or more Ki Spheres obtained*\n- All allies' ATK & DEF 50%{passiveImg:up_g}\n- Launches 2 additional attacks, each of which has a high chance of\nbecoming a Super Attack\n*When attacking with 12 or more Ki*\n- ATK & DEF 250%{passiveImg:up_g}\n*When attacking*\n- Randomly changes Ki Spheres of a certain Type (STR excluded)\nto STR Ki Spheres at the start of the character's next attacking turn",
